@startuml Sequence Diagram - Change Team Member Role

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "OrganizationView" as OrgView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> OrgView : 1 Open organization members page
activate OrgView
OrgView -> OrgView : 2 Display members list view

Admin -> OrgView : 3 Select member to change role
Admin -> OrgView : 4 Select new role
Admin -> OrgView : 5 Click "Change Role" button

OrgView -> OrgView : 6 Confirm role change action

OrgView -> ClerkAuth : 7 Send change role request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 8 Update member role in organization
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 9 Update organization records
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 10 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> OrgView : 11 Success notification
OrgView -> Admin : 12 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate OrgView

@enduml
